#: includes/rest/class-admin-routes.php:110
msgid "JSON text of the mapping to preview."
msgstr "Testo JSON del mapping da visualizzare in anteprima."

#: includes/rest/class-admin-routes.php:116
msgid "Item to preview; without it, the latest published item of every post type."
